{
  "name": "fairbooks-saas-seats",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/fairbooks-saas-seats",
  "description": "Fairbooks SaaS Seats: an MCP agent that finds unused, idle, duplicate, leaver and over-tiered SaaS seats (including AI tools) in CSV/JSON exports and estimates the saving, timed to each contract renewal and notice window. Writes a review sheet, a renewal calendar (.ics) and owner confirmation drafts, and compares two exports. Revoking is always one human click; it never changes any app itself.",
